<item><title>Sierra Leone regulator reports NLE 7.4 million in 2024 revenue</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sl/sierra-leone-regulator-reports-nle-7-4-million-in-2024-333409/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sl/sierra-leone-regulator-reports-nle-7-4-million-in-2024-333409/</guid><category>Sierra Leone</category><description>The electricity and water commission said revenue from levies and licenses rose from NLE 2.3 million in 2023.</description><pubDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 09:35:01 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sl.jpg" length="34790" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sl.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Sierra Leone&apos;s vice presidency has never produced an elected president</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sl/sierra-leone-s-vice-presidency-has-never-produced-an-b42fab/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sl/sierra-leone-s-vice-presidency-has-never-produced-an-b42fab/</guid><category>Sierra Leone</category><description>A February analysis by public policy analyst Foday M. Daboh says the office has often left its holders without an independent political base or a path to succession.</description><pubDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 09:35:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sl.jpg" length="34790" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sl.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Sierra Leone charcoal trade sustains livelihoods as tree loss threatens food security</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sl/sierra-leone-charcoal-trade-sustains-livelihoods-as-tree-a237a3/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sl/sierra-leone-charcoal-trade-sustains-livelihoods-as-tree-a237a3/</guid><category>Sierra Leone</category><description>A 65-year-old burner says his family depends on the trade, while the Environmental Protection Agency warns that producers are cutting fruit trees.</description><pubDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 09:35:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sl.jpg" length="34790" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sl.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Sierra Leone passes 2027 finance bill with tax changes</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sl/sierra-leone-passes-2027-finance-bill-with-tax-changes-a615e7/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sl/sierra-leone-passes-2027-finance-bill-with-tax-changes-a615e7/</guid><category>Sierra Leone</category><description>The amended bill sets out revenue measures including a Le10 annual poll tax and a 20% surcharge on qualifying imported goods.</description><pubDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 08:04:26 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/sl/sierra-leone-passes-2027-finance-bill-with-tax-changes-a615e7/share.jpg" length="39604" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/sl/sierra-leone-passes-2027-finance-bill-with-tax-changes-a615e7/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Sierra Leone Parliament receives five public-service audit reports</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sl/sierra-leone-parliament-receives-five-public-service-audit-3bec3e/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sl/sierra-leone-parliament-receives-five-public-service-audit-3bec3e/</guid><category>Sierra Leone</category><description>The reports, dated August 2026, examine building permits, maternal health, emergency care, electricity generation, education and waste management.</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 18:27:32 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sl.jpg" length="34790" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sl.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
